# Internal engineering notes: the record of how this was built, what broke, and
# why particular decisions were made. Kept out of the published repo because it
# is written as a working log rather than documentation, and because it quotes
# this machine's real network details, including an ISP-delegated IPv6 prefix.
#
# It stays on disk as an untracked file, so it survives `omarchy plugin update`.
NOTES.md

# Byte-cache Python may write next to bin/airplay-install-file if it is ever
# imported rather than executed. Never wanted in the published plugin.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Working reference on the marketplace reviewer's standard.
SECURITY.md
